      "writtenOn": "2021-06-23T11:14:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this reveals a bug in the VNDK libs gathering routine. libutils_product is a testing-purpose VNDK-EXT library. It should never be included in the VNDK APEX.\n\nI see that such a VNDK-EXT library is explicitly filtered-out [1]. So I don\u0027t understand how it appears with this change. Jooyung made that part, so he might have a clue. Adding him.\n\n\n[1] https://source.corp.google.com/android/build/soong/cc/vndk.go;rcl\u003dHEAD;l\u003d379",
      "parentUuid": "00cf7c1d_2ea98ffe",
      "revId": "756fb6afa2ba6a57b67ea78677acfb638f085b7f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
