      "writtenOn": "2021-06-22T18:43:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is comparing source modules the best comparison here? Why not just compare builtFile?\n\nHaving module names is useful in the error but I think it might be helpful to have the names of the source files as well.",
      "revId": "756fb6afa2ba6a57b67ea78677acfb638f085b7f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "695501ee_adb2a783",
