      "writtenOn": "2021-06-22T19:42:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not entirely sure if comparing modules is the best option here. If not, why not?\n\nBuiltFiles aren\u0027t really stable, and can represent the same file but in different locations, e.g.\nout/soong/.intermediates/external/libcxx/libc++/linux_glibc_x86_shared_apex10000/libc++.so\nand\nout/soong/.intermediates/external/libcxx/libc++/linux_glibc_x86_shared/libc++.so",
      "parentUuid": "cca31663_fa955053",
      "revId": "756fb6afa2ba6a57b67ea78677acfb638f085b7f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
